"Combined Display</link>"
msgstr ""

#: 08080000.xhp%23par_id3151172.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\".uno:StatusBarFunc\" visibility=\"visible\">Displays current "
"information about the active document.</ahelp>"
msgstr ""

#: 08080000.xhp%23par_id3156375.help.text
msgid ""
"When the cursor is in a named section, the section name appears. When the "
"cursor is in a table, the name of the table cell appears. The size of the "
"object is shown when you edit frames or drawing objects."
msgstr ""

#: 08080000.xhp%23par_id3145416.help.text
msgid ""
"When the cursor is positioned within text, you can double-click this field "
"to open the <link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\">"
"<emph>Fields</emph></link> dialog. In this dialog, you can define a field to "
"be inserted in your document at the current cursor position. When the cursor "
"is positioned in a table, a double-click in this field will call the <emph>"
"Table Format</emph> dialog. Depending on the object selected, you can call "
"up a dialog to edit a section, a graphic object, a floating frame, an OLE "
"object, direct numbering or the position and size of a drawing object."
msgstr ""

#: 10030000.xhp%23tit.help.text
msgid "Preview Zoom"
msgstr ""

#: 10030000.xhp%23hd_id3147175.help.text
msgid ""
"<link href=\"text/swriter/02/10030000.xhp\" name=\"Preview Zoom\">Preview "
"Zoom</link>"
msgstr ""

#: 10030000.xhp%23par_id3145244.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\"HID_PVIEW_ZOOM_LB\">Determines the zoom level of the page "
